{"step_index":135,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-01T14:12:16Z","input_tokens":2290,"cache_read_tokens":76031,"output_tokens":1422,"content":"All core modules and the **Hugging Face Spaces (Docker)** setup have been implemented and pushed to **[https://github.com/Aswin-2266/stream-vault.git](https://github.com/Aswin-2266/stream-vault.git)**!\n\n---\n\n### 🛠️ What Was Built\n\n1. **Hugging Face Spaces Cloud Config:**\n   - **[Dockerfile](file:///d:/Direct_Link/Dockerfile):** Installs Python 3.11, `ffmpeg` (for video splitting), `aria2` (for high-speed cloud leeching), and Python requirements. Configured to expose port `7860`.\n   - **[README.md](file:///d:/Direct_Link/README.md):** Formatted with Hugging Face Spaces frontmatter (`sdk: docker`, `app_port: 7860`).\n   - **[docs/huggingface-deploy.md](file:///d:/Direct_Link/docs/huggingface-deploy.md):** 3-minute deployment walkthrough with **zero credit card required**.\n\n2. **Core Bot & Streaming Engine:**\n   - **[config.py](file:///d:/Direct_Link/config.py):** Environment loader with configuration validation and whitelist parser.\n   - **[bot/utils/database.py](file:///d:/Direct_Link/bot/utils/database.py):** Asynchronous MongoDB client with regex search, deduplication, and file indexing.\n   - **[bot/utils/splitter.py](file:///d:/Direct_Link/bot/utils/splitter.py):** Lossless `ffmpeg` stream-copy splitter for files over 1.95 GB to comply with Telegram's free 2 GB upload limit.\n   - **[bot/utils/torrent.py](file:///d:/Direct_Link/bot/utils/torrent.py):** YTS/high-seed torrent searcher with multi-connection `aria2c` downloader.\n   - **[bot/utils/streamer.py](file:///d:/Direct_Link/bot/utils/streamer.py):** Embedded `aiohttp` web server supporting HTTP Range requests for instant seeking in VLC, MPV, or web browsers.\n\n3. **Telegram Handlers:**\n   - **[bot/handlers/start.py](file:///d:/Direct_Link/bot/handlers/start.py):** `/start` command with strict **whitelist security** checking.\n   - **[bot/handlers/indexer.py](file:///d:/Direct_Link/bot/handlers/indexer.py):** `/index @channel_username` crawler and auto-saver for media forwarded to the bot.\n   - **[bot/handlers/search.py](file:///d:/Direct_Link/bot/handlers/search.py):** Interactive inline search results with DDL stream links in captions, plus online torrent search button.\n   - **[bot/handlers/leech.py](file:///d:/Direct_Link/bot/handlers/leech.py):** Torrent download, video split, and vault upload handler with automatic local file cleanup.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Next Steps to Launch 24/7 on Hugging Face (Free)\n\nFollow the guide in [docs/huggingface-deploy.md](file:///d:/Direct_Link/docs/huggingface-deploy.md):\n1. Sign up on [huggingface.co](https://huggingface.co) (no credit card).\n2. Create a new **Docker Space** named `stream-vault`.\n3. Add your Telegram credentials and MongoDB URI under **Settings → Variables and secrets**.\n4. Push your repository to the Space using:\n   ```powershell\n   git remote add hf https://huggingface.co/spaces/<your-hf-username>/stream-vault\n   git push hf main --force\n   ```\n\nYour bot will build automatically, start up, and run 24/7 with 16 GB RAM and 50 GB storage!","thinking":"Dockerfile, README, and deployment documentation for the Hugging Face Space are now committed. The Docker setup includes the necessary dependencies, such as Python 3.11, ffmpeg, aria2, and git, as specified in the Dockerfile. The README provides the necessary metadata for the Hugging Face Space.\n\n\n"}
